      "body": "\n### Added\n\n- `pun pr edit` replaces a pull request description using `--body` or\n  `--body-file`, including stdin with `--body-file -`.\n- Automated tests on pull requests and pushes to `main`, followed by a release\n  build when the package version has not been published on Pushin.\n\n",
