      "body": "\n### Added\n\n- `pun release` commands to list, view, create, edit, and delete releases, upload\n  assets, and download assets with size and SHA-256 verification.\n- Automatic publication of platform archives, checksums, and changelog notes\n  from `scripts/release`, with resumable uploads through `scripts/publish-release`.\n\n",
